        <span class="lang-en" hidden>Moving is <em>this simple</em></span>
      </h2>
      <div class="stays-steps">
        <div class="stays-step rv">
          <h3><span class="lang-es">Explora y elige</span><span class="lang-en" hidden>Browse and pick</span></h3>
          <p>
            <span class="lang-es">Fotos reales, precios claros y reseñas de gente que ya vivió ahí. Sin crear cuenta.</span>
            <span class="lang-en" hidden>Real photos, clear prices and reviews from people who already lived there. No account needed.</span>
